@startuml
title Detailed Sequence Diagram: UC-04 Progress Monitoring
autonumber
skinparam maxMessageSize 150

actor "Manager" as Mgr
participant "WebDashboard\n<<React>>" as Web
participant "DashboardController\n<<Node.js API>>" as API
database "MySQL\n<<Database>>" as DB

Mgr -> Web: Select Project to View Dashboard
activate Web

Web -> API: GET /api/projects/{projectID}/dashboard
activate API

par Query Metrics Concurrently
    API -> DB: SELECT SUM(PlannedQty) FROM Tasks WHERE ProjectID={id}
    activate DB
    DB --> API: return totalPlanned
    deactivate DB
    
    API -> DB: SELECT SUM(Qty) FROM TaskProgress WHERE ProjectID={id}
    activate DB
    DB --> API: return totalCompleted
    deactivate DB
    
    API -> DB: SELECT SUM(LaborHours) FROM DailyReports WHERE ProjectID={id}
    activate DB
    DB --> API: return totalHours
    deactivate DB
end

API -> API: Calculate overall completion % (totalCompleted / totalPlanned)
API -> API: Format dashboard response payload

API --> Web: HTTP 200 OK (dashboardMetricsJSON)
deactivate API

Web --> Mgr: Render Progress Charts, Labor Graphs & Budget Variance
deactivate Web

@enduml